    "/* Painted over the grid rather than beside it, and put away before it by the same Esc: the\n            card is the topmost layer of the projector whenever it is up. */",
    "/* Inside the dialog rather than beside it: the panel owns the paint stack, and a pointer\n            drawn outside it would sit under the very slide it is meant to point at. */",
