    "// leaves a page nobody edited. Asserted live, because a seed that started paused proves only the",
    "// filter reads `is_enabled`.",
    "// The one the reader is allowed to reach still answers, so the refusals above are not the route",
    "// failing to serve any directory at all.",
    "// Not the title, not the count, not how many members it has.",
    "// The pages walk newest first, which is only decidable because each link was stamped apart.",
    "/**\n * The statements every collection read is built from, before a database ever sees them.\n *\n * An id or a timestamp spelled into the SQL text is a value that has to survive the schema's own quoting,\n * and a placeholder without a number is a bind this project's D1 statements cannot answer. Checked on the\n * generated text because a route that inlines one would still read correctly against the fixture — and\n * wrongly against anything else.\n */",
